WEBVTT

01:27.945 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:53.545 --> 01:54.585
Your Majesty,

01:54.665 --> 01:56.625
after days of investigation,
this is the only location we found.

01:57.625 --> 01:58.865
Kumor chose to set up camp here.

01:59.465 --> 02:01.305
With mountains on three sides,
it's easy to defend and hard to attack.

02:01.825 --> 02:03.025
And their defenses are extremely tight.

02:03.625 --> 02:06.025
The Xiaoxing Guards
haven't found a chance to slip inside.

02:06.985 --> 02:08.065
Any news of the Empress?

02:09.545 --> 02:10.825
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

02:10.905 --> 02:12.865
Kumor is still waiting
for the peace delegation,

02:12.945 --> 02:15.145
so he is unlikely to harm her rashly.

02:15.745 --> 02:16.705
But

02:17.265 --> 02:19.905
the delegation hasn't arrived
at the appointed time.

02:21.185 --> 02:22.305
What's Ling Jueding doing now?

02:23.025 --> 02:24.465
He's in the military camp
and has made no move.

02:25.065 --> 02:26.465
At least he still has some sense left.

02:26.545 --> 02:28.745
If he acts now,

02:28.825 --> 02:31.305
Cangcang's identity
will be exposed immediately.

02:33.545 --> 02:36.265
JIANGZHOU

02:54.945 --> 02:57.665
SEEK A SECLUDED
PLACE. AN HONORED GUEST WILL COME.

03:08.785 --> 03:09.865
Kumor.

03:11.425 --> 03:12.265
Kumor,

03:12.345 --> 03:13.945
what is that darn emperor,
Xiao Huan, trying to pull?

03:14.025 --> 03:16.065
Didn't he say someone
would arrive within five days?

03:16.145 --> 03:17.705
It's already the eighth. Where are they?

03:17.785 --> 03:18.825
Are they coming or not?

03:19.625 --> 03:21.705
We have his empress in our hands.

03:21.785 --> 03:23.145
Why panic?

03:23.865 --> 03:25.305
He's the one who should be anxious.

03:25.385 --> 03:28.585
But is Lin Cangcang really his empress?

03:28.665 --> 03:30.545
If she weren't,

03:30.625 --> 03:33.505
would that darn emperor have sent
a delegation at all?

03:34.025 --> 03:36.465
But if she is,
why are they dragging their feet?

03:37.385 --> 03:39.945
Naturally, they want to test our patience.

03:41.705 --> 03:42.705
That makes sense.

03:44.185 --> 03:46.625
But what Lin Cangcang said
didn't sound like lies.

03:47.545 --> 03:50.025
Minjia,
there's never too much deception in war.

03:50.545 --> 03:52.545
Have you forgotten
how we lost our provisions?

04:01.265 --> 04:02.745
If you're so curious,

04:03.265 --> 04:04.585
go and test her yourself.

04:05.665 --> 04:06.585
Test her?

04:07.105 --> 04:08.185
How?

04:29.985 --> 04:30.825
Your Majesty?

04:33.585 --> 04:36.305
Your subject Ling Jueding
greets Your Majesty.

04:37.665 --> 04:39.905
-Rise.
-Thank you, Your Majesty.

04:55.225 --> 04:57.545
It seems this outfit suits you well.

05:00.265 --> 05:01.305
It fits perfectly.

05:01.825 --> 05:03.665
Thank you for arranging it, Your Highness.

05:04.705 --> 05:07.185
You're a prisoner here.
Why are you still so cheerful?

05:07.265 --> 05:09.145
Why shouldn't I be?

05:09.225 --> 05:11.105
I eat well and sleep well here.

05:11.185 --> 05:12.705
It's far better than wandering homeless.

05:14.505 --> 05:17.145
Slick talk. Lies upon lies.

05:17.225 --> 05:19.585
I truly don't know why
Kumor values you so much.

05:19.665 --> 05:22.585
Indeed.
It is strange that your brother values

05:23.105 --> 05:24.265
a thief like me so much.

05:25.705 --> 05:27.505
The more you insist you're a thief,

05:27.585 --> 05:28.985
the more suspicious you seem.

05:29.705 --> 05:31.465
Then Your Highness might as well treat me
as the Empress.

05:31.985 --> 05:34.025
Since you're so easygoing,

05:34.105 --> 05:36.425
would you like to go for a ride with me?

05:36.945 --> 05:37.785
A ride?

05:38.305 --> 05:39.145
Yes.

05:40.185 --> 05:42.505
A perfect chance to get familiar
with the terrain.

05:43.945 --> 05:44.985
All right.

05:49.465 --> 05:50.705
It just occurred to me.

05:50.785 --> 05:52.065
Your surname is Lin,

05:52.145 --> 05:54.145
and so is that of the Jiangzhou commander.

05:54.905 --> 05:56.065
Is that really a coincidence?

05:56.585 --> 05:57.825
Mine is Lin, as in "forest."

05:58.345 --> 06:01.065
The Jiangzhou commander's is Ling,
as in "lingxiao flower."

06:01.705 --> 06:03.745
Different characters.

06:03.825 --> 06:04.905
Different pronunciations.

06:04.985 --> 06:05.825
Why,

06:06.345 --> 06:08.825
having fought General Ling
for so long, you can't even

06:08.905 --> 06:10.505
-get his surname right?
-You…!

06:11.185 --> 06:13.545
You're just a prisoner.
What gives you the right to mock me?

06:16.545 --> 06:18.705
I spoke out of turn.
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

06:19.625 --> 06:20.945
That's better.

06:21.025 --> 06:21.985
Don't forget.

06:22.065 --> 06:25.185
Your life is in my hands.

06:27.385 --> 06:28.225
Indeed.

06:28.745 --> 06:29.785
Wherever Your Highness wishes to go,

06:29.865 --> 06:32.305
I will follow and serve you.

06:32.825 --> 06:34.305
You sure are adaptable.

06:34.825 --> 06:37.745
Now I'm really inclined to believe
you're just a thief.

06:38.585 --> 06:39.585
Let's go.

06:39.665 --> 06:40.505
Yes.

07:04.505 --> 07:06.465
Your Majesty, their force is thin.

07:06.985 --> 07:08.625
Should we seize Her Majesty now?

07:08.705 --> 07:11.025
Not yet. They may have come out prepared.

07:11.105 --> 07:12.665
Send word to Ling Jueding.

07:12.745 --> 07:13.945
Tell him to act as circumstances require

07:14.025 --> 07:14.905
and put the big picture first.

07:16.185 --> 07:17.025
Understood.

07:38.945 --> 07:40.345
It's just a small city,

07:40.425 --> 07:42.865
yet Kumor's wasted so much time here.

07:42.945 --> 07:45.785
I want to see for myself
what exactly they're capable of.

07:45.865 --> 07:48.905
Your Highness,
the two armies are in a truce.

07:48.985 --> 07:50.185
This is provocation.

07:50.265 --> 07:51.665
So what if it is?

07:51.745 --> 07:52.985
You may be scared, but I'm not.

08:18.545 --> 08:20.305
Who goes there?

08:20.385 --> 08:21.545
Leave at once,

08:21.625 --> 08:23.145
and we may spare your lives!

08:23.825 --> 08:25.145
Come at us if you dare!

08:25.225 --> 08:26.225
You think I'm scared of you?

08:27.345 --> 08:30.985
Why is Minjia provoking them at the gates?

08:37.985 --> 08:38.825
General,

08:39.585 --> 08:40.865
it's Her Majesty.

08:48.105 --> 08:49.825
-Bring me a bow.
-General,

08:49.905 --> 08:50.905
Her Majesty is down there.

08:50.985 --> 08:52.225
That's precisely

08:52.745 --> 08:53.865
why I have to do this.

08:54.505 --> 08:56.265
Weren't you supposed to send
a peace delegation?

08:56.865 --> 08:57.705
Where are they?

08:57.785 --> 08:59.425
The whole of Great Qi

09:00.025 --> 09:01.625
is full of cowards!

09:09.625 --> 09:10.505
Is that all you can do?

09:12.105 --> 09:13.225
Loose!

09:48.545 --> 09:49.465
You?

09:50.305 --> 09:51.225
What are you doing here?

09:56.425 --> 09:57.265
If you want to live,

09:57.345 --> 09:58.665
leave at once!

09:59.185 --> 10:01.065
Otherwise, whoever you are,
I will show no mercy!

10:11.145 --> 10:12.025
Take her away.

10:37.785 --> 10:38.825
Wait.

10:41.585 --> 10:43.825
You two saved me today.

10:43.905 --> 10:46.025
I, Minjia, will remember it.

10:47.465 --> 10:49.625
Lin Cangcang, from this day on,

10:49.705 --> 10:51.545
you are my friend.

10:51.625 --> 10:53.385
We'll face life and death together

10:53.465 --> 10:54.625
and never betray one another.

10:57.905 --> 10:58.945
Kumor!

11:01.985 --> 11:03.225
Who are you?

11:08.185 --> 11:09.865
-What did you say?
-That's right.

11:10.465 --> 11:12.025
We used to be romantically involved.

11:12.105 --> 11:13.745
But we've already parted ways.

11:13.825 --> 11:15.185
Yes, we parted ways.

11:15.265 --> 11:16.665
But as you can see, I came after her.

11:17.265 --> 11:18.145
Tell me.

11:19.065 --> 11:20.345
How did you two meet?

11:20.865 --> 11:23.025
I founded Fenglai Pavilion
back in Southern Chu.

11:23.105 --> 11:24.545
She was recruiting a hall master,

11:24.625 --> 11:26.825
so I went to apply.
But she wouldn't choose me.

11:27.425 --> 11:28.625
He kept pestering me.

11:29.145 --> 11:30.585
Only later did I realize

11:32.505 --> 11:33.385
he had ulterior motives.

11:35.065 --> 11:36.225
What did he want?

11:36.305 --> 11:37.145
He…

11:39.385 --> 11:40.705
he wanted me.

11:41.305 --> 11:42.345
Love at first sight?

11:42.425 --> 11:44.225
She wanted to rescue the abducted youths.

11:44.745 --> 11:45.905
Even while gravely poisoned,

11:46.425 --> 11:48.625
she still tried to protect me out of duty

11:48.705 --> 11:49.825
as the Sect Leader.

11:49.905 --> 11:52.905
He did help me rescue
those children trapped in the mine,

11:53.865 --> 11:55.345
and he risked his life for me

11:55.865 --> 11:56.785
in the process.

11:56.865 --> 11:58.145
So you fell in love with him too?

11:58.225 --> 11:59.465
Then why did she come to Jiangzhou?

11:59.545 --> 12:01.985
-Why did you break up?
-And why did you come?

12:05.025 --> 12:06.905
-We were incompatible.
-That's it?

12:06.985 --> 12:10.225
She thought I couldn't give her
the freedom she wanted,

12:10.305 --> 12:11.425
so she left me.

12:12.345 --> 12:14.305
As for why and how she came here,

12:14.385 --> 12:15.905
I have no idea.

12:17.065 --> 12:18.865
I just wanted to find her.

12:19.425 --> 12:21.785
I heard someone spotted her in Jiangzhou,

12:21.865 --> 12:23.225
so I came.

12:26.305 --> 12:27.145
Kumor,

12:27.225 --> 12:28.545
why aren't you saying anything?

12:29.585 --> 12:31.625
Everything they said matches.

12:32.385 --> 12:34.425
They met in the martial world.

12:34.505 --> 12:37.265
One is the leader of Fenglai Pavilion,

12:37.945 --> 12:40.185
and the other is
a hall master chasing after her.

12:40.265 --> 12:42.785
They fought side by side,
saved people with their swords,

12:42.865 --> 12:43.825
fell in love,

12:44.585 --> 12:45.585
and later

12:45.665 --> 12:47.865
abroke up because of differences.

12:47.945 --> 12:49.625
Then Bai Chifan,

12:49.705 --> 12:52.265
still in love with Lin Cangcang,

12:52.345 --> 12:54.145
rushed here once he heard
of her whereabouts.

12:57.945 --> 12:59.465
Are you still suspicious of them?

13:01.025 --> 13:02.825
It all seems too much of a coincidence.

13:03.465 --> 13:06.105
But they clearly
had no time to coordinate a story.

13:06.745 --> 13:08.665
When I provoked
the Jiangzhou garrison earlier today,

13:08.745 --> 13:10.585
Bai Chifan saved the two of us
from the rain of arrows.

13:11.345 --> 13:12.785
When she saw him,
Lin Cangcang was startled

13:12.865 --> 13:14.825
and even a bit repulsed.

13:14.905 --> 13:17.185
Her reaction did not look fake.

13:17.265 --> 13:18.865
I'm sure

13:18.945 --> 13:21.465
she had no idea
Bai Chifan would turn up here.

13:22.905 --> 13:23.745
Yes,

13:25.225 --> 13:27.185
everything they said about Southern Chu

13:27.705 --> 13:29.225
lines up

13:29.745 --> 13:31.825
and sounds like lived experience,

13:31.905 --> 13:32.865
not something made up.

13:32.945 --> 13:34.585
But neither of them would elaborate

13:35.105 --> 13:36.225
on what happened
after they left Southern Chu.

13:36.825 --> 13:38.705
It's perfectly normal not to speak

13:38.785 --> 13:40.425
of painful things after a breakup.

13:40.505 --> 13:42.785
Besides, Kumor,
didn't you already test them?

13:43.425 --> 13:46.705
He didn't know she stole the Phoenix Seal

13:46.785 --> 13:48.225
or that she secretly joined the army.

13:49.225 --> 13:52.105
It makes sense that he knew nothing
about all that since they had broken up.

13:53.665 --> 13:56.105
The fact that their stories
line up so perfectly

13:56.985 --> 13:58.305
makes me even more uneasy.

13:59.145 --> 14:01.625
Kumor, you're overthinking it.

14:01.705 --> 14:04.225
The peace delegation will arrive
sooner or later.

14:04.305 --> 14:06.585
You'll know her identity then, won't you?

14:08.545 --> 14:09.385
Besides,

14:09.465 --> 14:11.945
from the way Ling Jueding shot at us
without hesitation,

14:12.745 --> 14:14.425
Cangcang is probably not the Empress.

14:14.505 --> 14:15.505
More importantly,

14:15.585 --> 14:17.185
the two of them saved me today.

14:17.265 --> 14:18.905
We can't repay kindness
with cruelty, can we?

14:33.705 --> 14:36.745
You two saved me today.
I'm truly grateful.

14:36.825 --> 14:38.185
Here's a toast to you both.

14:41.585 --> 14:42.585
No need for that, Your Highness.

14:42.665 --> 14:44.865
I only meant to save Cangcang.

14:45.505 --> 14:47.585
Saving you was pure coincidence.

15:04.345 --> 15:05.865
Mr. Bai, you traveled
all this way for your beloved.

15:06.465 --> 15:08.425
-How touching.
-General,

15:09.225 --> 15:12.185
I cut ties with this man long ago.
He has nothing to do with me.

15:12.265 --> 15:13.385
Cangcang,

15:14.145 --> 15:15.945
even though we're no longer together,

15:16.465 --> 15:19.545
I can't bear
to watch you treat yourself like this.

15:20.305 --> 15:22.425
Since we've gone our separate ways,

15:22.505 --> 15:25.065
what I do has nothing to do with you.

15:26.585 --> 15:27.665
Knowing you were captured,

15:27.745 --> 15:29.225
of course I was worried.

15:31.425 --> 15:33.145
You know perfectly well what it is

15:33.665 --> 15:34.945
you're truly worried about.

15:42.985 --> 15:45.785
Miss Lin, what do you think
Mr. Bai is worried about?

15:46.425 --> 15:47.785
You should ask him.

15:49.825 --> 15:50.665
Cangcang,

15:51.425 --> 15:54.185
my feelings for you are genuine.

16:04.785 --> 16:05.865
Mr. Bai,

16:06.465 --> 16:07.985
did you come all this way

16:08.065 --> 16:10.225
only to take your beloved with you?

16:11.625 --> 16:12.585
Of course.

16:13.385 --> 16:14.625
She may have left me,

16:15.945 --> 16:17.345
but I still love her.

16:18.465 --> 16:20.105
Today,

16:20.185 --> 16:22.625
Minjia went to the Jiangzhou gates

16:22.705 --> 16:24.305
on a whim.

16:24.385 --> 16:26.065
Bringing Miss Lin along

16:26.145 --> 16:27.545
was even more spur-of-the-moment.

16:27.625 --> 16:29.905
So how is it that you

16:29.985 --> 16:32.145
just happened to be there?

16:32.665 --> 16:36.385
Were you lying in wait near my camp?

16:37.585 --> 16:38.425
Yes.

16:39.745 --> 16:41.625
You are honest indeed, Mr. Bai.

16:42.745 --> 16:44.225
I knew Cangcang had been taken,

16:44.305 --> 16:46.025
so I kept watch here day and night.

16:46.905 --> 16:48.505
I wasn't about to let go

16:48.585 --> 16:49.825
of even the faintest hope.

16:50.345 --> 16:52.665
In this bitter cold,
night winds cut like knives.

16:52.745 --> 16:56.425
Your devotion to her truly runs deep.

16:57.705 --> 17:00.865
And I was rewarded.

17:01.745 --> 17:03.145
I found and saved her.

17:03.225 --> 17:04.825
What if you hadn't saved her?

17:06.345 --> 17:08.944
Then I would've died with her.

17:16.905 --> 17:17.865
Very well.

17:18.785 --> 17:21.505
I'll grant that wish

17:22.464 --> 17:25.265
and let you share life and death today.

17:25.825 --> 17:27.464
-Guards!
-Yes, General!

17:28.424 --> 17:30.025
Take these two away.

17:30.625 --> 17:31.705
Yes, General!

17:49.625 --> 17:50.465
General.

17:57.105 --> 17:58.625
Miss Lin, step outside.

18:00.305 --> 18:02.025
Weren't you going to keep me locked up?

18:02.105 --> 18:04.225
-What is this about?
-Come and see.

18:22.105 --> 18:23.625
What is this, General?

18:26.145 --> 18:27.705
Mr. Bai said earlier

18:27.785 --> 18:29.145
that he kept watch

18:29.225 --> 18:31.585
near my camp day and night
just to rescue you.

18:32.545 --> 18:34.905
Since he's not afraid
of Xijiang's freezing winds,

18:34.985 --> 18:37.705
I'd like to see
how long he can endure them.

18:40.665 --> 18:43.105
I was just worrying about
how to shake him off.

18:44.905 --> 18:46.345
Thank you, General, for helping me.

18:51.825 --> 18:53.585
You two were once in love.

18:54.225 --> 18:56.145
Miss Lin, don't you care at all?

18:56.745 --> 18:58.545
I've already chosen to leave him behind,

18:59.065 --> 19:00.505
so why cling to the past?

19:01.265 --> 19:02.505
Even so,

19:03.065 --> 19:05.345
he risked his life to rescue you.

19:05.865 --> 19:08.145
Can you really bear to watch him suffer?

19:08.225 --> 19:09.145
General,

19:09.985 --> 19:12.105
I'm your prisoner now.

19:12.185 --> 19:13.265
I can barely protect myself.

19:13.785 --> 19:15.025
How could I worry about anyone else?

19:21.025 --> 19:23.105
If you beg me,

19:24.145 --> 19:26.185
I might let him go.

19:32.185 --> 19:34.025
If begging really works,

19:35.185 --> 19:36.265
can I beg you to let me go?

19:38.505 --> 19:39.825
That's unlikely.

19:41.945 --> 19:43.825
He and I have nothing
to do with each other.

19:44.345 --> 19:45.465
You may deal with him
as you wish, General.

20:12.545 --> 20:13.425
What a pity.

20:14.785 --> 20:16.505
Your old flame

20:17.065 --> 20:19.145
doesn't seem to care for you at all.

20:20.225 --> 20:21.065
It doesn't matter.

20:22.065 --> 20:23.585
I came here of my own will.

20:24.425 --> 20:25.665
I accept whatever punishment comes my way.

20:33.305 --> 20:34.545
Interesting.

20:35.705 --> 20:37.265
You two…

20:37.345 --> 20:40.825
One is devoted, while the other
is indifferent.

20:42.225 --> 20:43.425
Very well.

20:44.145 --> 20:45.785
Enjoy the cold.

21:14.425 --> 21:15.345
Minjia.

21:16.025 --> 21:18.065
Cangcang, why did you call for me?

21:18.145 --> 21:19.225
I knew you'd still be awake.

21:19.305 --> 21:20.145
Sit.

21:23.505 --> 21:24.465
I saw

21:24.545 --> 21:26.785
Bai Chifan tied to the pillar.

21:26.865 --> 21:28.265
He looked like he was about to die.

21:30.105 --> 21:32.625
I'm telling you your lover is dying.

21:34.785 --> 21:36.465
Do you really not care?

21:37.345 --> 21:38.185
Former lover.

21:40.825 --> 21:42.185
He's just my former lover.

21:42.705 --> 21:44.745
Why should I care?

21:46.025 --> 21:48.265
But he's handsome,

21:48.345 --> 21:50.625
skilled, and absolutely devoted to you.

21:51.225 --> 21:54.065
Don't tell me you feel nothing at all.

21:55.105 --> 21:56.825
In my opinion, life is short.

21:56.905 --> 21:58.905
Outcomes don't matter.

21:58.985 --> 22:01.225
Living each day well
is what truly matters.

22:05.825 --> 22:07.625
Princess Minjia,

22:08.145 --> 22:09.945
are you feeling sorry for him?

22:10.705 --> 22:12.465
This isn't pity.

22:12.545 --> 22:14.145
I think he's a good man.

22:14.225 --> 22:15.785
I like him.

22:15.865 --> 22:18.585
If you don't want him, give him to me.

22:18.665 --> 22:20.585
I don't care about outcomes anyway.

22:20.665 --> 22:21.985
Sure.

22:22.505 --> 22:24.025
You can have him.

22:24.625 --> 22:27.225
But right now, he's probably
freezing to death thanks to your brother.

22:27.985 --> 22:30.105
Not while I'm here.

22:38.025 --> 22:38.865
Xiao Huan,

22:39.385 --> 22:40.985
this is all I can do for you.

23:21.265 --> 23:22.185
What are you looking at?

23:24.825 --> 23:26.305
The stars.

23:26.385 --> 23:28.385
They are especially bright here.

23:29.705 --> 23:31.385
Haven't you seen stars before?

23:32.905 --> 23:34.185
It's been two years

23:35.705 --> 23:38.785
since I last looked up properly.

23:39.865 --> 23:41.305
You're unbelievable.

23:41.825 --> 23:44.505
In a situation like this,
you still care about stargazing?

23:46.065 --> 23:48.265
At least we're under the same sky now.

23:48.785 --> 23:50.265
That's a kind of bond, isn't it?

24:02.985 --> 24:04.625
Just sharing

24:05.745 --> 24:07.225
the same sky is enough for you?

24:11.065 --> 24:12.505
Being able to see her again at all

24:13.025 --> 24:14.465
is already a rare blessing.

24:14.985 --> 24:16.465
I doubt I can hope for anything more.

24:19.665 --> 24:21.425
You're easy to satisfy.

24:23.265 --> 24:24.105
Too bad

24:24.625 --> 24:26.185
she said she didn't care for you anymore.

24:26.265 --> 24:27.865
She's giving you to me.

24:29.545 --> 24:30.945
Your Highness must be joking.

24:31.665 --> 24:34.705
A princess like you
will find a fine match.

24:36.025 --> 24:37.385
You really are devoted.

24:38.665 --> 24:39.665
Let me warn you,

24:39.745 --> 24:42.385
the night winds here can freeze
cattle and sheep to death.

24:43.385 --> 24:44.425
Aren't you afraid of the cold?

24:48.065 --> 24:50.105
No, I'm used to it.

24:54.345 --> 24:55.185
Here, Mr. Bai,

24:56.265 --> 24:57.825
take this cloak.

25:02.465 --> 25:03.825
Make it through the night.

25:18.625 --> 25:19.985
Kumor, I tested

25:20.665 --> 25:22.025
both of them as you said.

25:22.105 --> 25:23.585
I don't think they're faking it.

25:27.585 --> 25:28.585
Minjia,

25:29.265 --> 25:30.865
you grew up on the steppe.

25:31.465 --> 25:33.545
You don't know how cunning
the Central Plains people can be.

25:33.625 --> 25:34.745
But Kumor,

25:34.825 --> 25:36.905
Bai Chifan saved my life.

25:37.665 --> 25:38.865
If you let him freeze to death,

25:39.745 --> 25:41.425
that wouldn't be right.

25:44.145 --> 25:45.065
Minjia,

25:46.065 --> 25:47.865
don't tell me
you've taken a liking to him.

25:48.385 --> 25:49.585
Of course not.

25:49.665 --> 25:52.785
Why would I fall for someone
whose heart belongs to another?

25:54.665 --> 25:57.545
I'm just touched by his devotion.

26:00.545 --> 26:01.745
Don't worry.

26:01.825 --> 26:03.345
He won't die yet.

26:03.425 --> 26:05.505
We'll decide his fate

26:05.585 --> 26:06.945
after the delegation comes.

26:09.025 --> 26:10.905
-Is the hot water ready?
-Yes, Your Highness.

26:10.985 --> 26:12.265
The braziers are lit too.

26:12.345 --> 26:13.465
Mr. Bai,

26:13.545 --> 26:14.785
I've prepared a tent for you.

26:14.865 --> 26:16.425
Take a hot bath once you get there.

26:16.505 --> 26:18.345
I added herbs to help you warm up.

26:19.345 --> 26:20.225
Thank you, Your Highness.

26:20.745 --> 26:22.185
Come on, let's head back.

26:29.225 --> 26:30.425
Didn't expect that.

26:30.505 --> 26:32.705
You braved the northern wind
all night and are still standing.

26:32.785 --> 26:34.385
It seems I underestimated you.

26:34.465 --> 26:36.585
I've roamed the martial world for years.

26:36.665 --> 26:38.425
A bit of cold wind

26:38.945 --> 26:39.785
is nothing.

26:40.465 --> 26:41.945
In that case,

26:42.025 --> 26:43.905
stay out for a few more nights.

26:43.985 --> 26:44.905
Kumor,

26:44.985 --> 26:46.745
I'm indebted to Mr. Bai.

26:46.825 --> 26:48.465
I won't let you treat him like this.

26:48.545 --> 26:50.025
Mr. Bai, let's go.

27:14.625 --> 27:17.065
Is she really not the Empress?

27:18.105 --> 27:19.865
General, the delegation
from Great Qi is at the gate.

27:20.465 --> 27:22.305
Very well. Let them in.

27:22.385 --> 27:23.225
Yes, General.

28:17.585 --> 28:19.145
-Cangcang.
-Minjia?

28:19.665 --> 28:21.065
The delegation from Great Qi is here.

28:21.585 --> 28:22.625
-They're here?
-Let's go.

28:22.705 --> 28:23.705
Kumor's waiting for us.

28:24.225 --> 28:25.065
Come on.

28:52.145 --> 28:54.185
Du Tingxin, envoy of Great Qi,

28:54.705 --> 28:56.465
greets General Kumor.

28:59.705 --> 29:00.945
By order of His Majesty,

29:01.465 --> 29:02.985
I've come to negotiate peace.

29:05.505 --> 29:08.425
Looks like I hold
quite a place in the eyes

29:08.505 --> 29:09.665
of the Emperor of Great Qi.

29:10.705 --> 29:12.945
He actually sent
the Imperial Preceptor here.

29:13.025 --> 29:14.145
This shows

29:14.665 --> 29:15.985
His Majesty's sincerity.

29:16.065 --> 29:17.185
Very well.

29:17.945 --> 29:20.265
Then let me show your emperor

29:20.345 --> 29:21.505
my sincerity as well.

29:22.745 --> 29:23.785
Bring her up!

29:47.305 --> 29:48.305
General.

29:50.905 --> 29:51.945
Preceptor Du,

29:52.465 --> 29:54.585
aren't you going to kneel
before your empress?

29:54.665 --> 29:56.065
The Empress?

29:57.105 --> 29:57.945
Where?

30:03.305 --> 30:07.065
Didn't the Emperor of Great Qi
receive my letter?

30:08.545 --> 30:09.825
Calm down, General.

30:10.345 --> 30:13.025
I came precisely to address this matter.

30:17.545 --> 30:19.665
This is a handwritten letter
from His Majesty.

30:20.185 --> 30:22.585
Please see for yourself.

30:41.465 --> 30:42.825
THE PHOENIX SEAL OF GREAT QI
RECENTLY WENT MISSING.

30:42.905 --> 30:44.665
I HEARD IT WAS FOUND
BY GENERAL KUMOR, SO I SENT A DELEGATION

30:44.745 --> 30:46.105
TO RETRIEVE THE STOLEN SEAL,
RECLAIM THE CAPTIVES, AND NEGOTIATE PEACE.

30:52.905 --> 30:55.145
The Empress of Great Qi is still
in the palace?

30:55.225 --> 30:56.465
Yes.

30:57.185 --> 30:59.185
Her Majesty is safe and sound.

30:59.825 --> 31:01.345
His Majesty sent this delegation

31:02.065 --> 31:03.585
to retrieve the stolen Phoenix Seal,

31:03.665 --> 31:04.505
reclaim the captives,

31:04.585 --> 31:06.665
and negotiate terms

31:07.265 --> 31:08.465
for peace.

31:10.305 --> 31:11.465
Preceptor Du,

31:11.985 --> 31:12.905
do you know this woman?

31:22.745 --> 31:23.985
This is the thief?

31:26.625 --> 31:28.585
How dare you steal the Phoenix Seal?

31:28.665 --> 31:30.025
Your crime is unforgivable!

31:30.105 --> 31:31.025
Guards,

31:31.105 --> 31:33.025
take her back to Jiangzhou for punishment!

31:33.105 --> 31:34.185
-Wait.
-Understood.

31:37.745 --> 31:39.105
No need for all that trouble.

31:42.625 --> 31:44.505
According to custom in Xijiang,

31:44.585 --> 31:47.945
a thief's right hand is chopped off
in public

31:48.025 --> 31:49.625
and thrown in the wilderness
to feed the wolves.

31:51.465 --> 31:52.505
In that case,

31:53.225 --> 31:54.385
let's follow local custom.

32:00.785 --> 32:02.425
Do you have anything to say?

32:05.025 --> 32:05.945
General,

32:06.625 --> 32:07.745
to the Imperial Preceptor,

32:08.825 --> 32:10.705
I am indeed a thief
who stole the Phoenix Seal.

32:11.625 --> 32:12.465
I have nothing to say.

32:26.265 --> 32:28.185
Please do the honors, Preceptor Du.

32:30.545 --> 32:32.265
Then please have your men

32:32.345 --> 32:34.705
hold the thief down.

32:53.865 --> 32:55.025
Preceptor Du,
your inner force may be mediocre,

32:55.945 --> 32:58.425
but your resolve
to chop off her hand is admirable.

32:59.385 --> 33:00.225
What is it?

33:01.265 --> 33:03.305
Have you changed your mind
about punishing her?

33:04.905 --> 33:07.225
Since she is not the Empress of Great Qi,

33:07.745 --> 33:10.505
her matter can wait.

33:12.065 --> 33:13.385
Let us discuss real business.

33:14.185 --> 33:17.145
Since you were sent
by the Emperor of Great Qi,

33:17.225 --> 33:18.745
you must have brought
some token of sincerity.

33:23.625 --> 33:24.665
Bring it up!

33:46.905 --> 33:47.745
What is this?

33:47.825 --> 33:49.585
Do you think you can

33:50.465 --> 33:52.305
buy me off with a bit of money?

33:52.385 --> 33:54.785
This is 3,128 liang and nine qian of gold.

33:55.385 --> 33:56.745
It is not "a bit of money."

33:59.265 --> 34:02.545
This is the money people in Xijiang paid
to purchase proper status

34:03.385 --> 34:05.505
after the status verification system
was implemented last year.

34:06.025 --> 34:08.185
I had the Ministry of Revenue
convert it into gold

34:08.784 --> 34:10.105
and brought it here to you.

34:10.865 --> 34:12.824
I didn't go through all this trouble

34:13.425 --> 34:14.665
for a bit of gold.

34:16.225 --> 34:18.065
Since the status verification system
was enforced,

34:18.585 --> 34:20.505
those without proper status
have been reduced to slaves.

34:21.264 --> 34:23.945
Ordinary folk have had no choice
but to purchase good status.

34:24.824 --> 34:26.625
How is this any different
from daylight robbery?

34:28.385 --> 34:29.865
If the system is not abolished,

34:30.744 --> 34:32.065
this gold you brought

34:32.784 --> 34:34.545
will be nothing but a drop in the ocean.

34:34.625 --> 34:36.185
General, mind your words.

34:37.264 --> 34:38.744
The status verification system is
a national policy

34:39.945 --> 34:41.985
established to maintain order.

34:42.625 --> 34:43.985
How can it be abolished so easily?

34:44.585 --> 34:45.784
You are mistaken, Preceptor Du.

34:47.185 --> 34:48.705
Only when all people are free and equal

34:49.225 --> 34:50.304
can the land be at peace.

34:51.744 --> 34:52.625
As I see it,

34:52.705 --> 34:56.025
the status verification system
is the very cause of chaos in the land.

34:56.744 --> 34:59.705
I am merely carrying out orders
to deliver this gold to you, General.

35:00.305 --> 35:01.785
Matters regarding the system

35:02.945 --> 35:05.065
are not for me to decide.

35:08.225 --> 35:11.385
I've heard you're
the Emperor of Great Qi's trusted aide.

35:11.985 --> 35:14.905
Seeing you today, I can't imagine why.

35:18.065 --> 35:21.985
I will report your thoughts
to His Majesty.

35:23.465 --> 35:24.385
Good.

35:24.985 --> 35:26.265
Please do.

35:27.385 --> 35:29.505
When you decide to abolish

35:29.585 --> 35:31.185
the status verification system,

35:32.225 --> 35:34.505
I will consider
when to withdraw my troops.

35:36.145 --> 35:38.025
General, are you truly turning down

35:39.025 --> 35:40.825
3,000 liang of gold?

35:42.025 --> 35:43.305
Did I say I was?

35:44.265 --> 35:48.145
Aren't the Phoenix Seal and the captives
worth 3,000 liang of gold?

35:48.745 --> 35:50.225
General, how bold you are.

35:55.865 --> 35:57.025
Very well.

35:57.105 --> 35:58.065
In that case,

35:58.665 --> 36:00.225
the gold is yours.

36:00.825 --> 36:03.945
As for the captives, the Phoenix Seal,
and her, I'm taking them all.

36:04.025 --> 36:07.265
Preceptor Du,
you are being a bit too greedy.

36:07.345 --> 36:08.345
You may take the captives.

36:08.945 --> 36:12.105
As for the Phoenix Seal and her,
you may choose only one.

36:18.665 --> 36:21.305
Then please, chop off her hand
and feed it to the wolves for me.

36:43.185 --> 36:46.305
As for the Phoenix Seal and her,
you may choose only one.

36:48.225 --> 36:50.905
Then please, chop off her hand
and feed it to the wolves for me.

36:54.305 --> 36:56.145
The Preceptor never intended
to take me away.

36:56.985 --> 36:58.745
Was she acting on his orders?

37:00.225 --> 37:01.145
No matter.

37:02.185 --> 37:03.985
I am no longer the Empress of Great Qi.

37:04.505 --> 37:06.545
Why should I care what he wants?

37:08.225 --> 37:11.265
If the Preceptor can at least tell Jueding
that I'm safe,

37:11.905 --> 37:13.545
it will put his mind at ease.

37:14.585 --> 37:15.905
If I can use this opportunity

37:16.505 --> 37:18.305
to learn the Black Tiger Army's defenses…

37:21.625 --> 37:22.665
What are you thinking?

37:22.745 --> 37:23.825
Nothing.

37:24.345 --> 37:25.545
Are you sad?

37:26.225 --> 37:27.305
Of course.

37:28.145 --> 37:29.705
All the captives have left.

37:29.785 --> 37:30.705
I'm the only one left behind.

37:40.865 --> 37:43.425
General, you don't still think
I'm the Empress of Great Qi, do you?

37:46.345 --> 37:47.625
To be honest,

37:48.625 --> 37:50.145
I still have a tiny bit of doubt.

37:51.905 --> 37:54.905
But right now, I see no reason

37:54.985 --> 37:56.705
to believe you are.

37:57.345 --> 37:59.065
Then what do you plan to do with me?

38:01.065 --> 38:02.225
I intend

38:02.305 --> 38:04.185
to treat you two

38:04.265 --> 38:05.145
as honored guests.

38:05.745 --> 38:07.065
When the war ends,

38:07.145 --> 38:08.785
I will see you both off myself.

38:10.345 --> 38:12.265
This is how you treat honored guests?

38:12.345 --> 38:14.065
You're practically putting me
under house arrest.

38:15.105 --> 38:17.585
Inside the camp,
you two are free to go wherever you like.

38:18.505 --> 38:20.785
But if either of you steps outside,

38:21.385 --> 38:22.865
don't blame me for being ruthless.

38:29.625 --> 38:30.465
All right.

38:31.105 --> 38:32.905
Since you're so "hospitable,"

38:33.425 --> 38:35.945
I suppose I'll stay.

38:37.865 --> 38:39.305
But there is one thing I don't understand.

38:39.385 --> 38:41.545
Now that you know I'm not the Empress,

38:41.625 --> 38:43.745
why haven't you killed me?

38:47.585 --> 38:48.585
I can't bear to.

38:54.625 --> 38:55.745
I just think

38:56.265 --> 38:57.945
that you are a woman of honor.

38:58.025 --> 38:59.905
You stole provisions to save the people.

38:59.985 --> 39:02.065
I admire that.

39:04.905 --> 39:05.945
Rest assured.

39:06.025 --> 39:09.065
Since I said
I'd treat you as honored guests,

39:09.585 --> 39:10.505
I'll keep my word.

39:12.745 --> 39:13.585
Good.

39:27.945 --> 39:28.945
Your Highness.

39:29.025 --> 39:30.465
Mr. Bai, are you better now?

39:32.385 --> 39:34.025
Thank you for the cloak.

39:40.465 --> 39:41.585
Cangcang?

39:44.065 --> 39:46.225
She should have left with the delegation.

39:46.305 --> 39:47.865
Why is she still here?

39:54.345 --> 39:55.265
Yes, that's Cangcang.

39:55.345 --> 39:56.425
What's wrong?

39:58.025 --> 39:58.985
Nothing.

40:00.465 --> 40:02.385
Did
the delegation from Great Qi come today?

40:02.465 --> 40:04.505
They did. And they've already left.

40:05.345 --> 40:06.785
Can you believe my brother?

40:06.865 --> 40:08.025
Earlier,

40:08.105 --> 40:10.905
he suspected
that Lin Cangcang was the Empress

40:10.985 --> 40:12.625
and even had me follow the two of you.

40:12.705 --> 40:13.545
Only when the delegation

40:13.625 --> 40:16.145
confirmed her identity today
did he finally relax.

40:17.185 --> 40:18.385
If you ask me,

40:18.465 --> 40:20.065
the whole thing is simple.

40:20.145 --> 40:22.545
If Cangcang were the Empress,

40:23.065 --> 40:25.865
wouldn't that make you the Emperor?

40:27.905 --> 40:28.745
Exactly.

40:34.145 --> 40:36.385
QI

40:40.385 --> 40:41.225
General.

40:43.305 --> 40:44.825
Greetings, Preceptor Du.

40:49.625 --> 40:51.745
General Ling, no need to look around.

40:52.385 --> 40:53.345
Her Majesty

40:54.545 --> 40:55.385
is not with us.

40:55.465 --> 40:56.425
Why not?

40:58.425 --> 41:01.865
Kumor made me choose
between the 300 captives and Her Majesty,

41:03.545 --> 41:06.465
but she would rather die
than admit who she was.

41:07.705 --> 41:09.665
I had no choice but to respect her wishes,

41:10.465 --> 41:12.065
so I only retrieved
the stolen Phoenix Seal

41:12.585 --> 41:14.265
and brought back the captives.

41:14.345 --> 41:15.825
Then what about my sister?

41:16.425 --> 41:17.905
Her Majesty put the greater good first.

41:18.425 --> 41:20.185
Heaven will watch over her.

41:24.465 --> 41:25.465
I will also

41:26.145 --> 41:28.345
pray for her safety day and night.

41:36.865 --> 41:37.745
Cangcang.

41:39.025 --> 41:39.865
Minjia?

41:41.025 --> 41:42.465
Why are you staying
in your tent all the time?

41:42.545 --> 41:43.785
Why not go out for a walk?

41:44.705 --> 41:45.865
What's the point?

41:45.945 --> 41:46.945
I can't leave the camp anyway.

41:47.865 --> 41:50.185
What, do you know somewhere worth going?

41:50.865 --> 41:52.625
I wish.

41:52.705 --> 41:53.785
I still have to clean the stables
this afternoon.

41:54.465 --> 41:55.585
Clean the stables?

41:56.705 --> 41:58.345
A princess like you
cleans the stables yourself?

41:58.425 --> 41:59.825
Of course.

41:59.905 --> 42:01.065
As my brother says,

42:01.145 --> 42:03.145
there are no princesses in the camp,
only soldiers.

42:04.145 --> 42:05.305
If I want to stay here,

42:05.385 --> 42:07.385
I have to work like everyone else.

42:08.625 --> 42:09.705
Anyway, enough about that.

42:09.785 --> 42:12.145
I snuck out to chat with you.

42:13.225 --> 42:14.145
About what?

42:15.305 --> 42:17.865
If it's about Bai Chifan, forget it.

42:19.025 --> 42:20.625
That's exactly what I want to talk about.

42:21.145 --> 42:23.265
Why did you break up with him?

42:24.225 --> 42:26.145
He clearly cares for you deeply.

42:29.465 --> 42:31.705
I used to think so too.

42:32.505 --> 42:33.825
Only later did I realize

42:35.025 --> 42:35.865
he had ulterior motives.

42:37.345 --> 42:39.105
Mr. Bai is not that kind of man.

42:39.185 --> 42:40.705
He risked his life to save you.

42:41.425 --> 42:42.265
Enough.

42:43.305 --> 42:44.505
I don't want to talk about him.

42:54.585 --> 42:57.185
I bet you still have feelings for him.

42:57.945 --> 43:00.985
If you truly didn't care,
you wouldn't sound so bitter.

43:01.065 --> 43:03.625
You say you've moved on,

43:03.705 --> 43:05.505
but you still hold grudges.

43:06.825 --> 43:07.865
If you ask me,

43:08.385 --> 43:11.185
your anger comes from love.

43:18.065 --> 43:19.105
Really?

43:24.025 --> 43:25.305
I hit the mark, didn't I?
